             '\n'
             'Changed in version 3.11: Starred elements are now allowed in '
             'the\n'
             'expression list.\n'
             '\n'
             '\n'
             'The "try" statement\n'
             '===================\n'
             '\n'
             'The "try" statement specifies exception handlers and/or cleanup '
             'code\n'
