                  '\n'
                  'object.__repr__(self)\n'
                  '\n'
                  '   Called by the "repr()" built-in function to compute the '
                  'â€œofficialâ€\n'
                  '   string representation of an object.  If at all possible, '
                  'this\n'
                  '   should look like a valid Python expression that could be '
