             '   the current scope.\n'
             '\n'
             '   New in version 3.2.\n'
             '\n'
             'alias [name [command]]\n'
             '\n'
             '   Create an alias called *name* that executes *command*.  The '
             'command\n'
             '   must *not* be enclosed in quotes.  Replaceable parameters can '
             'be\n'
             '   indicated by "%1", "%2", and so on, while "%*" is replaced by '
