 'typesmapping': 'Mapping Types â€” "dict"\n'
                 '**********************\n'
                 '\n'
                 'A *mapping* object maps *hashable* values to arbitrary '
                 'objects.\n'
                 'Mappings are mutable objects.  There is currently only one '
